### Get all users
# Option A (dynamic): run auth/login.http once this session first —
#   {{authToken}} gets set automatically by the post-response script.
# Option B (static token APIs): skip login.http entirely and use
#   {{apiToken}} from http-client.private.env.json directly instead —
#   just swap the header below to `Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}`.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
